## Suggested Development Roadmap

Rather than trying to build everything at once, I'd break it into milestones:

| Version  | Focus                                                     |
| -------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |
| **v0.1** | Project generator, snippets, templates, basic workspace   |
| **v0.2** | Custom tree view (Characters, Lore, Manuscript)           |
| **v0.3** | Commands (New Character, New Chapter, Export)             |
| **v0.4** | Live Codex generation from Markdown links                 |
| **v0.5** | Timeline builder and relationship graph                   |
| **v0.6** | Lore validation and consistency checking                  |
| **v0.7** | AI integration with prompt/history management             |
| **v1.0** | Full publishing pipeline, dashboards, search, polished UI |

This staged approach keeps the project manageable while delivering useful functionality at each release, instead of waiting until every planned feature is complete.
